WEBVTT

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:12.570
<b>I tried coming alone to our usual park.</b>

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:16.070
<b>It's a feeling I've never felt.</b>

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:21.660
<b>Like a child, frightened by the sound of the wind</b>

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:25.670
<b>I ran back along the path home.</b>

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:33.970
<b>The sky outside the window is too vast. Where are you now?</b>

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:36.130
<b>Please, may this reach you...</b>

00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:44.690
<b>Dear Lord, if you ever grant wishes,</b>

00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:50.110
<b>grant my wish right now, please!</b>

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:56.240
<b>I want to hear your voice, I miss you! I want to see you now!</b>

00:00:56.240 --> 00:01:00.830
<b>Why must you already be looking toward tomorrow?</b>

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:06.210
<b>Don't just brush it off, saying the time has slipped by.</b>

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:08.540
<b>Once more...</b>

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:14.550
<b>I love you, and yet it's been too late since long ago.</b>

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:19.140
<b>Even if I give up, it can't be like the past.</b>

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:24.350
<b>Don't just decide so simply there's no way, no choice.</b>

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:28.230
<b>Smile once more.</b>

00:01:32.530 --> 00:01:34.440
Dr. Minami?

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:39.700
Yes. The man who offered to 
stop the Skrugg's sphere.

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:46.150
Oh! Dr. Minami is working together 
with the NIA to capture the Ghost, yes?

00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:51.920
Yes, and he has used that position to 
seize control of some military units.

00:01:51.920 --> 00:01:53.480
What?!

00:01:53.480 --> 00:01:57.970
Hughes was the first to notice, and it seems 
he is attempting to regain control, but...

00:01:57.970 --> 00:02:00.550
Currently Minami has gone completely rogue.

00:02:02.010 --> 00:02:04.060
Let me introduce you!

00:02:04.060 --> 00:02:07.820
<i>This</i> is art in movement!

00:02:07.820 --> 00:02:10.730
MR-1!

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:12.610
MR-1?

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:15.750
I know! I know!

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:18.110
I know your weakness!

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:22.660
You're not equipped with 
any long range weaponry!

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:27.150
As long as I stay outside of your attack 
range, there's nothing to worry about!

00:02:27.150 --> 00:02:29.950
Fire!

00:02:36.360 --> 00:02:38.360
Heroman...

00:02:39.460 --> 00:02:42.490
That's enough, Dr. Minami!

00:02:42.490 --> 00:02:44.430
Surrender at once!

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:46.850
This battle ends now!

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:51.230
Fine, I get it. Just like you asked...

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:54.770
I'll end this battle now!

00:03:15.230 --> 00:03:16.840
Heroman has been...

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:24.090
I did it! I finally did it!

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:29.400
This is proof that my MR-1 is the 
most powerful in the universe!

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:36.550
Now there is nothing left that 
can stand against my invention!

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:52.210
What's this?

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:56.960
Heroman's power comes from electricity.

00:03:56.960 --> 00:04:00.950
Heroman was born that night 
from a bolt of lightning.

00:04:00.950 --> 00:04:04.800
And all his techniques so far use electricity!

00:04:11.070 --> 00:04:14.140
So no matter how powerful that attack might be...

00:04:14.820 --> 00:04:17.060
...if it uses the power of electricity...

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:20.290
...there's no way that it could defeat Heroman!

00:04:21.490 --> 00:04:23.650
Heroman...

00:04:24.340 --> 00:04:25.860
Go!

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:28.580
Crap!

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:35.920
That's the perfect distance for Heroman!

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:37.960
I don't think so!

00:04:49.550 --> 00:04:50.930
Heroman!

00:04:57.600 --> 00:04:58.770
Emergency pullback!

00:05:04.350 --> 00:05:05.740
You think you can escape?

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:08.990
Heroman...

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:11.990
Magnecto!

00:05:27.520 --> 00:05:29.570
You annoying little...

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:36.100
Did I get him?

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:45.960
How dare you!

00:06:01.100 --> 00:06:03.950
You can't keep your distance any longer!

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:19.560
Fine! I accept your challenge!

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:24.300
Beating you to a pulp at your own 
specialty of hand-to-hand fighting,

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:29.070
will make the MR-1's victory just that 
much more beautiful and convincing!

00:06:37.050 --> 00:06:38.910
It's on, Ghost!

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:46.000
Dr. Minami, won't you stop already?

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:49.290
Cease the fighting at once and surrender!

00:06:49.290 --> 00:06:50.510
Surrender?

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:55.500
Yes! You are charged with treason!

00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:57.480
What might you be talking about?

00:06:57.480 --> 00:06:58.970
Playing dumb isn't going to work!

00:06:58.970 --> 00:07:00.570
You'd better be prepared for the consequences.

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:04.900
Oh, I see. I really do apologize then.

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:10.570
...did you seriously expect me 
to say something like that?!

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:13.270
Minami, you fiend!

00:07:13.270 --> 00:07:15.020
This conversation ends now!

00:07:15.020 --> 00:07:18.400
I think you people should keep quiet!

00:07:18.400 --> 00:07:20.240
Secretary!

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:21.870
Roger.

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:27.090
Oh, no! Everyone, emergency evasive maneuvers!

00:07:36.420 --> 00:07:37.430
Mr. Hughes!

00:07:38.400 --> 00:07:40.850
What are you doing? Stabilize us already!

00:07:40.850 --> 00:07:44.190
I can't! All the electronic 
equipment is inoperable!

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:46.440
That missile again?

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:52.760
It might not work against the 
Ghost, but it sure works on you.

00:07:52.760 --> 00:07:57.370
Now then, with no more people getting in 
my way, I can fight to my heart's content!

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:10.440
Look, smoke!

00:08:10.440 --> 00:08:12.750
Good, it seems they're at it again.

00:08:12.750 --> 00:08:15.050
H-Hey, isn't that it?

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:23.600
I won't let you!

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:27.190
I'll fling you around and around!

00:08:35.930 --> 00:08:39.300
Don't go thinking some chain 
is going to defeat me!

00:08:40.220 --> 00:08:43.660
Everyone, can you see what is happening here?

00:08:44.430 --> 00:08:50.200
<i>This footage is the scoop of the century, 
brought to you exclusively by the All-American Network!</i>

00:08:50.200 --> 00:08:54.950
<i>The Ghost behind the incidents 
all over the news yesterday</i>

00:08:54.950 --> 00:08:57.720
<i>and a robot created with the intent 
of getting adopted into the military,</i>

00:08:57.720 --> 00:09:00.720
<i>are engaged in a fierce battle!</i>

00:09:04.740 --> 00:09:05.730
That's...

00:09:05.730 --> 00:09:09.860
Impossible! I thought that 
there was a press gag order!

00:09:10.820 --> 00:09:12.690
That's a TV station?

00:09:12.690 --> 00:09:14.450
The press?

00:09:15.130 --> 00:09:16.450
Excellent!

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:21.080
I'll crush you in front of a wide audience!

00:09:24.450 --> 00:09:27.290
Please look at the person 
underneath the helicopter!

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:30.540
He's the leading robotics expert, Dr. Minami!

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:38.840
Which means that robot with the giant arms 
must be the MR-1, which Dr. Minami created!

00:09:38.840 --> 00:09:44.060
The MR-1 was called in by the military in 
order to try and stop the Skrugg's sphere.

00:09:44.510 --> 00:09:48.600
But right before it could be used, 
the sphere stopped on its own.

00:09:48.600 --> 00:09:52.730
After that, it's been involved in 
the reconstruction of Center City!

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:57.000
This robot has been custom reconfigured for battle,

00:09:57.000 --> 00:09:59.240
and is running wild!

00:09:59.550 --> 00:10:04.060
On the other hand the Ghost has often appeared 
in Center City helping with the reconstruction,

00:10:04.060 --> 00:10:07.540
and was thought to be an ally of justice 
among the citizens of the city!

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:12.750
But thanks to certain "news" reports, 
uncertainty has grown about it...

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:19.500
Yes! It was that news about the 
incident at the reconstruction site!

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:28.520
Being flung around like this isn't 
going to get Heroman and me anywhere.

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:29.940
What should I do?

00:10:57.780 --> 00:11:00.470
We've come out to a fun place, haven't we?

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:03.910
Here we will decide this battle.

00:11:10.780 --> 00:11:13.690
Run, run!

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:17.190
At least until you have no where left to stand!

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:19.400
What is he...

00:11:19.400 --> 00:11:20.190
Heroman!

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:24.590
Joey!

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:26.690
Mr. Hughes!

00:11:27.090 --> 00:11:28.060
You're hurt?

00:11:28.060 --> 00:11:30.650
Don't worry. Just a scratch.

00:11:30.650 --> 00:11:35.210
I'm sorry. I wasn't able to stop Minami myself.

00:11:35.210 --> 00:11:40.130
It's okay. This way the military 
people aren't targeting me, right?

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:42.490
That's thanks to you, Mr. Hughes.

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:51.330
Dr. Minami can think of nothing else than 
defeating Heroman with his own robot.

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:58.720
Minami has been plotting all kinds of things to 
get the MR-1 officially adopted into the military.

00:11:58.720 --> 00:12:03.090
Heroman defeated the Skrugg before 
he was able to face off against them.

00:12:03.090 --> 00:12:08.750
So he thinks defeating the thing that destroyed 
the Skrugg will be the ultimate demonstration.

00:12:09.590 --> 00:12:12.730
That's why he turned Heroman into the bad guy?

00:12:12.730 --> 00:12:15.450
Yes, but that's not all.

00:12:15.450 --> 00:12:20.130
He completely loathes Heroman 
for taking his spotlight.

00:12:20.720 --> 00:12:22.200
That's why?

00:12:23.190 --> 00:12:26.800
Joey... I mean, Joseph Carter Jones...

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:28.100
I have a request.

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:32.980
This is an official request from 
the NIA, speaking for the President.

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:36.470
Stop Dr. Minami going out of control.

00:12:36.470 --> 00:12:41.480
We want you to destroy the MR-1 
before there are any more victims.

00:12:43.600 --> 00:12:44.440
Yes, sir!

00:12:47.100 --> 00:12:48.880
Heroman...

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:51.490
Go!

00:13:06.630 --> 00:13:09.140
I'll smash you to bits!

00:13:12.280 --> 00:13:14.390
This time I'll...

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:25.280
How dare you!

00:13:29.730 --> 00:13:30.970
Heroman!

00:13:32.170 --> 00:13:35.290
Heroman!

00:13:39.650 --> 00:13:41.130
T-They fell!

00:13:42.650 --> 00:13:44.960
Heroman, I'm coming!

00:13:49.320 --> 00:13:50.390
This is...

00:13:51.770 --> 00:13:54.150
Could it be... His energy is...

00:13:54.150 --> 00:13:55.390
What in the world...

00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:00.590
What's the matter, Joey?

00:14:00.590 --> 00:14:03.190
Mr. Hughes, I need a favor!

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:26.440
It seems like the Ghost is okay!

00:14:26.440 --> 00:14:30.260
Meanwhile the MR-1 is still 
underwater, with no sign of it!

00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:32.840
Has the battle been decided?

00:14:32.840 --> 00:14:36.550
Dr. Minami has been observing the battlefield.

00:14:36.940 --> 00:14:38.630
Damaged report: check.

00:14:38.630 --> 00:14:40.200
Balancers reconfigured.

00:14:40.200 --> 00:14:41.960
Standby power operational.

00:14:42.880 --> 00:14:45.480
MR-1, reactivate!

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:02.730
Commence attack!

00:15:06.490 --> 00:15:09.300
The battle has started up again!

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:10.130
But...

00:15:10.750 --> 00:15:11.720
This is bad, Joey!

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:23.310
The dam! The dam is being destroyed 
by the attacks on Heroman from the MR-1!

00:15:23.310 --> 00:15:25.020
This isn't good... At this rate...

00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:38.990
Heroman!

00:15:45.080 --> 00:15:46.370
This is...

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:58.930
The Ghost has started using himself 
to block the MR-1's spears!

00:15:58.930 --> 00:16:02.310
Fool! Even if you protect the damn,

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:05.810
you'll be trashed to pieces!

00:16:09.630 --> 00:16:11.070
Heroman...

00:16:12.400 --> 00:16:13.570
Let's hurry.

00:16:14.150 --> 00:16:15.050
Joey!

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:18.240
What could Dr. Minami be thinking?

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:20.090
If the dam is destroyed,

00:16:20.090 --> 00:16:23.580
it's obvious there will be a large number
of casualties from people downstream!

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:29.330
<i>And besides, Dr. Minami continues to attack 
relentlessly with the weapon he created</i>

00:16:29.330 --> 00:16:32.910
<i>while the Ghost, labeled as "evil" by the world,</i>

00:16:32.910 --> 00:16:36.350
<i>is doing everything it can to protect the dam!</i>

00:16:36.350 --> 00:16:40.320
<i>This is a live broadcast that 
has not been edited in any way!</i>

00:16:40.320 --> 00:16:44.060
<i>What does everyone feel when watching this?</i>

00:16:44.400 --> 00:16:47.060
<i>I can only see it one way!</i>

00:16:47.060 --> 00:16:50.820
<i>He is not something that threatens humanity!</i>

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:55.020
<i>He is something that is here 
protecting us, being our shield!</i>

00:16:55.020 --> 00:16:57.740
<i>He, indeed, is our...</i>

00:17:01.400 --> 00:17:03.370
...new hero!

00:17:07.150 --> 00:17:09.330
Damn. Out of ammo.

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:29.650
This is the final blow!

00:17:33.700 --> 00:17:35.320
W-What's happening?

00:17:43.420 --> 00:17:47.500
Joey... The electricity generator 
should be running at full power now.

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:49.620
Thank you!

00:17:49.620 --> 00:17:52.550
But, is this really going to...

00:17:52.550 --> 00:17:55.380
Heroman needs to eat, too.

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:57.130
The power plant is...

00:17:57.130 --> 00:17:58.930
T-This isn't good...

00:17:58.930 --> 00:18:00.590
This isn't good at all!

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:53.770
Heroman...

00:18:55.650 --> 00:18:56.780
Attack!

00:18:57.360 --> 00:18:59.870
Damn you!

00:19:09.650 --> 00:19:11.300
Trying to blind me?

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:17.100
Fool! Even if I can't see 
from above, the MR-1 can see!

00:19:22.220 --> 00:19:23.970
There!

00:19:27.780 --> 00:19:29.970
Dr. Minami, above you.

00:19:35.050 --> 00:19:37.820
Heroman...

00:19:39.650 --> 00:19:41.070
Blast!

00:20:26.850 --> 00:20:29.580
He did it! The Ghost has won!

00:20:37.710 --> 00:20:40.900
Heck, yeah!

00:20:43.580 --> 00:20:44.670
...ahem.

00:20:46.830 --> 00:20:48.390
My hero...

00:20:59.770 --> 00:21:03.190
And that's how we stopped being fugitives.

00:21:03.970 --> 00:21:08.200
Thanks to Mr. Hughes all the 
charges on us were cleared.

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:11.130
And thanks to that live broadcast,

00:21:11.130 --> 00:21:16.170
Heroman turned from a bad guy
into an ally of justice overnight.

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:18.740
<i>What's the connection between 
Dr. Minami and the government?</i>

00:21:18.740 --> 00:21:20.850
<i>Did the government really chase down the Ghost?</i>

00:21:19.530 --> 00:21:21.710
<i>No comment! No comment!</i>

00:21:22.770 --> 00:21:26.980
As for the mad scientist Dr. 
Minami and his followers...

00:21:35.610 --> 00:21:40.070
And that's how I returned 
to my normal, everyday life!

00:21:43.490 --> 00:21:46.530
Joey, could you get me another cup of coffee?

00:21:46.530 --> 00:21:47.570
Sure!

00:21:50.440 --> 00:21:51.920
Welcome!

00:21:52.490 --> 00:21:55.290
Hey Joey. You look the same as ever.

00:21:56.220 --> 00:21:57.590
Mr. Hughes!

00:22:01.330 --> 00:22:02.710
Get me a coffee.

00:22:07.700 --> 00:22:08.970
Sure!

00:22:29.310 --> 00:22:32.400
<b>I want to get to know you better,</b>

00:22:32.400 --> 00:22:35.490
<b>to go at each other with our true feelings.</b>

00:22:35.490 --> 00:22:41.830
<b>Your tears and smile are both here.</b>

00:22:42.290 --> 00:22:46.260
<b>No matter how hard it is, I won't be scared any more.</b>

00:22:46.260 --> 00:22:49.320
<b>With both of us, we can go anywhere.</b>

00:22:49.320 --> 00:22:54.760
<b>Since you're the one who taught me that I'm not alone.</b>

00:22:54.760 --> 00:23:02.450
<b>Every time I mutter the words "I was born to meet you"</b>

00:23:03.120 --> 00:23:07.490
<b>my unease disappears, and my heart burns stronger.</b>

00:23:07.880 --> 00:23:14.440
<b>Thank you. We'll go on together with a sign only we understand.</b>

00:23:14.880 --> 00:23:19.300
<b>Carve out this irreplaceable time!</b>

00:23:20.540 --> 00:23:23.840
<b>I can't move away from here.</b>

00:23:23.840 --> 00:23:28.060
<b>Because I live feeling the same heartbeat.</b>

00:23:28.580 --> 00:23:30.280
<b>I want to protect you to the very last,</b>

00:23:30.280 --> 00:23:32.680
<b>to protect the promise built up.</b>

00:23:33.460 --> 00:23:40.080
<b>Thank you. We'll go on together with a sign only we understand.</b>

00:23:40.300 --> 00:23:45.810
<b>We are carving out this irreplaceable time!</b>

00:23:50.820 --> 00:23:52.400
On the next Heroman:

00:23:53.100 --> 00:23:55.410
Freedom is really the best!

00:23:55.410 --> 00:23:56.620
Nothing better than peace and quiet!

00:23:56.900 --> 00:23:59.200
After the end of their fugitive days,

00:23:59.200 --> 00:24:02.300
Joey and the others enjoy 
a brief period of peace.

00:24:02.300 --> 00:24:06.370
But in that shadow a new danger lurks.

00:24:06.370 --> 00:24:09.400
An unexpected creature appears 
before Joey and the others.

00:24:09.400 --> 00:24:11.920
He gives them a warning.

00:24:12.300 --> 00:24:15.950
Next time on Heroman #17: Legacy.

00:24:15.950 --> 00:24:18.780
Heroman... Attack!
